0,Tataltepec Chatino - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tataltepec_Chatino,"Tataltepec Chatino, also known as Lowland Chatino and Chatino Occidental Bajo, is an indigenous Mesoamerican language, one of the Chatino family of the Oto-Manguean languages. It is not intelligible with other Chatino languages.","Chatino, Tataltepec",Otomanguean
1,"Chatino, Tataltepec Language (CTA)... | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/cta/,Tataltepec Chatino is an endangered indigenous language of Mexico. It belongs to the Otomanguean language family.,"Chatino, Tataltepec",Otomanguean
2,Chatino Tataltepec Bible - Google Play 앱,https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.wycliffe.chatinotataltepec.cta&hl=ko,"Chatino Tataltepec Bible. Wycliffe Bible Translators, Inc.대체 언어 이름 : Chatino de la Costa, Cha’jna'a, Chatino Occidental Bajo, Lowland Chatino [ISO 639-3 : cta]. Tataltepec의 Chatino에서 더 많은 리소스를 보려면 www.ScriptureEarth.org 를 방문하십시오.","Chatino, Tataltepec",Otomanguean
3,The story and methods of the Chatino Language,https://scholarspace.manoa.hawaii.edu/server/api/core/bitstreams/c3d4624e-7e6e-4e30-897a-30a37b77a867/content,"He furthermore shows that Eastern Chatino and Tataltepec Chatino form a proper sub-group, Coastal Chatino, that is coordinate with Zenzontepec Chatino, the family’s farthest outlier.","Chatino, Tataltepec",Otomanguean
