8,"Chatino, Tataltepec in Mexico people group profile | Joshua Project",https://joshuaproject.net/index.php/people_groups/15282/MX,"Tataltepec Chatino peoples need to put Jesus Christ at the center of their spiritual lives. Saints, spirits and witchcraft are a poor substitute for the King of kings. They need freedom from the fear of spirits that are no match for the power of Christ.","Chatino, Tataltepec",Otomanguean
